cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using this file."
type: software

title: "WittScape: Explicit Witt Bases and Bruhat–Tits Building Computations for Elliptic Maximal Tori in Split SO(5)"

authors:
  - family-names: "Bairakji"
    given-names: "Serine"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Serine-325/SO5-Witt-Basis"

url: "https://so5-witt-basis.onrender.com"

abstract: >-
  WittScape is a Python research software package for
  explicit Witt basis constructions and Bruhat–Tits
  building computations for elliptic maximal tori in
  split SO(5).
  The software covers sums of two quadratic extensions,
  biquadratic extensions, and quartic extensions.
  It includes constructive norm witnesses, admissibility
  checks, symbolic Gram-matrix verification, building
  point computations, automated tests, and an interactive
  Streamlit application.